  data: {
    LLM: "1. **Wagering**: Players place bets. 2. **Deal**: Players and dealer receive two cards. 3. **Player Turn**: Players choose to 'Hit' (take card), 'Stand' (keep hand), 'Double Down' (double bet for one card), or 'Split' (split pairs). 4. **Dealer Turn**: Dealer reveals hole card and must hit until reaching 17+. 5. **Settlement**: Higher hand wins; dealer bust pays all remaining players.",
    Player: "1. **Wagering**: Players place bets. 2. **Deal**: Players and dealer receive two cards. 3. **Player Turn**: Players choose to 'Hit' (take card), 'Stand' (keep hand), 'Double Down' (double bet for one card), or 'Split' (split pairs). 4. **Dealer Turn**: Dealer reveals hole card and must hit until reaching 17+. 5. **Settlement**: Higher hand wins; dealer bust pays all remaining players.",
    objective: "Achieve a hand value closer to 21 than the dealer's hand, without exceeding 21.",
    gameplay: "1. **Wagering**: Players place bets. 2. **Deal**: Players and dealer receive two cards. 3. **Player Turn**: Players choose to 'Hit' (take card), 'Stand' (keep hand), 'Double Down' (double bet for one card), or 'Split' (split pairs). 4. **Dealer Turn**: Dealer reveals hole card and must hit until reaching 17+. 5. **Settlement**: Higher hand wins; dealer bust pays all remaining players.",
    keyRules: [
      'Aces count as 1 or 11.',
      'Face cards (K, Q, J) count as 10.',
      'Blackjack (Natural 21) typically pays 3-to-2.',
      "Insurance is offered if the dealer's upcard is an Ace.",
